---
---
<section class="bg-paper pb-[var(--space-section)]" aria-labelledby="journey-heading">
  <div class="container-x text-center">
    <h2
      id="journey-heading"
      class="text-[length:var(--text-h2)] font-[800] leading-[var(--text-h2--line-height)] tracking-[-0.01em]"
    >
      Unite your customer journey
    </h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[length:var(--text-lead)] leading-relaxed text-ink-70">
      Streamline communication throughout your entire customer lifecycle with personalized,
      engaging conversations. Heymarket lets you build dynamic flows that automate communications
      from that first promotional touchpoint to nurturing long-term customer relationships.
    </p>
    <a
      href="#"
      class="group mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-purple underline underline-offset-4"
    >
      See all features
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" />
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="container-x mt-12 sm:mt-14">
    <img
      src="/heymarket-website/assets/mock-journey-flow.webp"
      alt="An automated customer journey flow: promo email sent, order placed, order confirmation sent, delivery received, then a review request, illustrated around a shopper receiving packages."
      width="1214"
      height="534"
      loading="lazy"
      class="mx-auto h-auto w-full max-w-[1120px]"
    />
  </div>
</section>
